  <acqinfo id="a2a7ca2eb04d378d733619ad91f1384f">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>Ford Foundation archive was deposited at the RAC in 2011. Ford Foundation records, correspondence, reports, program files, and officers' papers were transferred to and accessioned by the RAC beginning in 2011. Accessions continue as necessary. </p><p>This material was transferred to the RAC in one accession in 2023 and was ingested by the RAC as Accession 2023:025.</p>  </acqinfo>
  <scopecontent id="4ff897a10bb5ebcfa733a8e6eea6354e">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>The collection contains the office files Sayiddah McCree created and maintained when she served as an Investments Associate in the Ford Foundation's Mission Investments Program. The collection consists of one series of McCree's subject files. </p><p>Through documenting McCree's work in Mission Investments, the collection provides insight into the early history of the program which the Foundation launched in 2017. McCree's files concern strategy, initiatives, meetings, and program actions for fostering inclusive capitalism. </p><p>The collection is mainly comprised of reports and meeting materials. There are also notes, correspondence, and other publications.</p>  </scopecontent>
